{"runId":"repair-denied-correction-2026-09-06","accountLabel":"F1 Finance Officer","groupId":"D19","area":"Dashboard","step":3,"question":"那只解释任务总览和注意事项有什么区别，不用读取我的数据。","conversationId":"conv_73dc42dc9eda4aef8ef4","accepted":true,"duplicate":false,"timedOut":false,"maxSeq":30,"durationMs":13663,"skillId":"admin_portal_reader","category":"portal_reader","reader":{"result":"success","page":"","section":"","sourceSection":"","selectedState":"","scope":"unknown","workflowState":"","answerShape":"overview","completeness":"bounded","facts":["'My Tasks' is the authoritative Dashboard overview of the current user's task workload grouped by visible task category.","'Needs Your Attention' is the authoritative personal-attention list.","Neither 'My Tasks' nor 'Needs Your Attention' may be appended to or substituted for a workload overview unless separately requested."],"missing":[]},"plan":{"facts":[],"missing":[]},"actionEvidence":[],"answer":"好的，仅就这两个视图的概念做说明，不涉及您的数据。\n\n在管理门户中，**“任务总览”（My Tasks）** 是您当前任务工作负载的仪表板视图，按可见的任务类别分组展示，用来查看整体工作分布。\n\n**“注意事项”（Needs Your Attention）** 则是单独列出的个人待关注列表，用于集中呈现需要您本人处理的事项。\n\n两者的主要区别是：任务总览侧重展示工作负载概貌，而注意事项侧重标记出需要您个人关注的内容。它们是两个独立视图，不能互相替代，也不能合并后当作完整的工作总览——除非您分别请求查看对应视图。","terminalEvent":"turn.completed","eventTypes":["user.message","turn.started","assistant.status","skill.route","reader.result","assistant.message","turn.completed"],"auditEvidence":[{"recordType":"reader.evidence","category":"dsh","payload":{"facts":[],"missing":[],"stage":"knowledge_only","qualityTrace":[{"stage":"question_context","status":"passed","failureCode":"","durationMs":"0"},{"stage":"identity_permissions","status":"passed","failureCode":"","durationMs":"271.2"},{"stage":"knowledge_retrieval","status":"passed","failureCode":"","durationMs":"1076.6"},{"stage":"planning","status":"passed","failureCode":"","durationMs":"1622.5"},{"stage":"result_classification","status":"passed","failureCode":"","durationMs":"0"}],"permission":{"fingerprint":"d41b7f639223ec9b2b206416bb1